*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% HP LaserJet CP1025 on macOS: cgpdftoraster -> rastertopksm -> foo2zjs (see driver/macos/README.md).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "CP1025FZ.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(HP LaserJet CP 1025)"
*ModelName: "HP LaserJet CP1025 foo2zjs"
*ShortNickName: "HP LaserJet CP1025 foo2zjs"
*NickName: "HP LaserJet CP1025 foo2zjs"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Hewlett-Packard;MDL:HP LaserJet CP 1025;CMD:ZJS;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: CMYK
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "16"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/foo2zjs/cp1025-foo2zjs"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImageableArea[11.52 11.52 583.48 830.48]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImageableArea[11.52 11.52 600.48 780.48]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% 96 printer dots of clipping at 600 dpi on every edge = 11.52 pt.
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "11.52 11.52 583.48 830.48"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "11.52 11.52 600.48 780.48"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Black and White: "<</cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel CMYK/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 6/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution
*% End
